From d646552086f9a9dc634fb3917bc70706a60859af Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: reaper <theunbounddeveloper@outlook.com>
Date: Fri, 16 Oct 2026 14:43:01 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] version: Reaper_v3.4.5

Since v3.4.4: a factory Reaper box can join an AiMesh system as a node
again (WPS on its onboarding band for the join only, the WPS setting
untouched); Access Point, Media Bridge and the return to Router run
Reaper's own step page instead of the stock wizard, and the MLO page's
"Get started" opens the Wireless console; the QoS engine cards use two
colours only.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 release/src-rt/version.conf | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/release/src-rt/version.conf b/release/src-rt/version.conf
index 88aa9a9f16..ca557d3065 100644
--- a/release/src-rt/version.conf
+++ b/release/src-rt/version.conf
@@ -4,6 +4,6 @@ KERNEL_VER_AM=$(subst .,,$(KERNEL_VER))
 FS_VER_AM=$(subst .,,$(FS_VER))
 
 SERIALNO=102.8
-EXTENDNO=Reaper_v3.4.4
+EXTENDNO=Reaper_v3.4.5
 
 RCNO=0
-- 
2.25.1

